@startuml
title V6 Java 血缘系统核心类调用关系（简版）

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #52677A
  ArrowColor #496780
  FontColor #1F2937
}

class LineageController #E8F3FF {
  +importJob()
  +graph()
  +evidence()
}

class ImportJobs #EAF8EE {
  +submit()
  +get()
}

class LineageStore #EAF8EE {
  +importFiles()
  +snapshot()
  +reassign()
}

class LineageDocumentAdapter #FFF1E8 {
  +parseAndNormalize()
}

class DruidValueLineageDecider #FFF1E8 {
  +suppliesTargetValue()
}

class LineageGraph #F0ECFF {
  +subgraph()
  +evidence()
  +impact()
}

class MappedLineageGraph #F0ECFF {
  +subgraph()
  +mappingStatus()
}

class JdbcLineageRepository #FFF7D6 {
  +loadDocuments()
  +replaceAll()
}

LineageController --> ImportJobs : 提交增量任务
LineageController --> LineageStore : 查询血缘
ImportJobs --> LineageStore : importFiles()
LineageStore --> LineageDocumentAdapter : 解析并校验 JSON
LineageDocumentAdapter --> DruidValueLineageDecider : SQL 值来源判断
LineageStore --> LineageGraph : 构建原始图
LineageStore --> MappedLineageGraph : 构建业务映射图
LineageStore --> JdbcLineageRepository : 读取 / 事务保存

note bottom of JdbcLineageRepository
  保存历史状态
  支持 SQLite / GaussDB
end note

legend bottom
  箭头表示主要方法调用；省略 DTO、辅助类和次要方法
endlegend
@enduml
